{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549440/extras/33c082043c8cd3c0417018460e7aa0e3.avif?t=1750741189\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549440/extras_big/33c082043c8cd3c0417018460e7aa0e3.avif?t=1750741189 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All new 2D mode with full native Steam Deck support\u00a0</strong>\u2014 Select VR or 2D mode on launch or run the game natively on the Steam Deck or Linux.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gripper's is leaping into VR</strong> \u2014 bringing over 40 mind-bending puzzles designed to test your wits and reflexes in a whole new dimension!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you reach the treasure at the end?</strong><br>Each level challenges you to think creatively and make the most of your environment \u2014 all in full VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Puzzle Highlights:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use blocks to block enemy sightlines and sneak your way through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn defeated enemies into makeshift rafts to cross water</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master teleportation mechanics to move yourself, blocks, and other objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect every key to unlock the exit and advance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All-new VR controls let you zoom in and out for a fresh perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 handcrafted puzzles, with more on the way post-launch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal hand-holding for a rewarding challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quirky, fun story with charming characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by a beloved classic game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free puzzle updates and new modes coming soon</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a puzzle master or just getting started, <i>Gripper's VR</i> will pull you in with its clever mechanics and imaginative world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549440/extras/026a98c15bf8a070602d0f9fa9830d0b.avif?t=1750741189\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549440/extras_big/026a98c15bf8a070602d0f9fa9830d0b.avif?t=1750741189 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Blob your first Squirrel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549440/af84f717bcee1656f6a45f129f268580858cf42f.jpg"},{"name":"Blob your first Monster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549440/11313bbb547b601586e3b366b00f983b971254ed.jpg"},{"name":"Hit your First Target","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549440/e9cb48d470413e7770e448f36e4e1f9cf6371e27.jpg"},{"name":"Completed 10 Puzzles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549440/4731292b0e6e0b645c3de8815b24ec8590b3617d.jpg"},{"name":"Completed 20 Puzzles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549440/4731292b0e6e0b645c3de8815b24ec8590b3617d.jpg"},{"name":"Completed 30 Puzzles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549440/4731292b0e6e0b645c3de8815b24ec8590b3617d.jpg"},{"name":"Find the treasure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549440/4245ba4d7c2a57f18afb4059d134aeaa8057b1c3.jpg"},{"name":"Surf's Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549440/23e248d8f16091675c1895104618c4d1ece6f0ae.jpg"},{"name":"Ouch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549440/e0236997f5c0dd428ca879ec6280c9cc38e63bb0.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549440?t=1750741189","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549440?t=1750741189","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549440/dd0e5e2b1d52553122246547391e694580e420b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750741189","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549440/dd0e5e2b1d52553122246547391e694580e420b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750741189","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3827310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549440/extras/33c082043c8cd3c0417018460e7aa0e3.avif?t=1750741189\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549440/extras_big/33c082043c8cd3c0417018460e7aa0e3.avif?t=1750741189 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All new 2D mode with full native Steam Deck support\u00a0</strong>\u2014 Select VR or 2D mode on launch or run the game natively on the Steam Deck or Linux.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gripper's is leaping into VR</strong> \u2014 bringing over 40 mind-bending puzzles designed to test your wits and reflexes in a whole new dimension!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you reach the treasure at the end?</strong><br>Each level challenges you to think creatively and make the most of your environment \u2014 all in full VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Puzzle Highlights:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use blocks to block enemy sightlines and sneak your way through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn defeated enemies into makeshift rafts to cross water</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master teleportation mechanics to move yourself, blocks, and other objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect every key to unlock the exit and advance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All-new VR controls let you zoom in and out for a fresh perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 handcrafted puzzles, with more on the way post-launch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal hand-holding for a rewarding challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quirky, fun story with charming characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by a beloved classic game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free puzzle updates and new modes coming soon</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a puzzle master or just getting started, <i>Gripper's VR</i> will pull you in with its clever mechanics and imaginative world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549440/extras/026a98c15bf8a070602d0f9fa9830d0b.avif?t=1750741189\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549440/extras_big/02